    "description": "Experience personalized mobile themes and let \"Theme App\" bring unique style and functionality to your phone.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\nFree theme change - Theme App allows you to easily change the home screen theme and have a new feeling every day!\r\n\r\nFunctional widgets - Our calendar and clock widgets are not only beautiful, but also have practical functions. Widgets change the traditional screen appearance and bring you a new visual experience.\r\n\r\nDIY application icons - Want to make your application icons unique? Theme App allows you to customize the icons of application to show your personality.\r\n\r\nUnique Icon Pack - Carefully designed icons that perfectly match your theme make your desktop more unified and harmonious.\r\n\r\nRegular updates - We are constantly updating and improving to bring you the latest designs and features.\r\n\r\nHow to use:\r\n\r\nDownload and install Theme App.\r\n\r\nOpen the app and select your favorite theme.\r\n\r\nPersonalize your icons and widgets to let them reflect your style.\r\n\r\nDownload \"Theme App\" now and start personalizing your phone today!",
